      <p class="author-name">Mike Lucas — Founder, HELOCEdge.com</p>
      <p class="author-desc">Mike is a UK-based personal finance researcher who built HELOCEdge.com after studying the US home equity market and finding that millions of American homeowners struggle to make sense of their borrowing options. He monitors Federal Reserve policy, tracks HELOC rate movements, and writes all content on this site with one goal: helping US homeowners make confident, informed decisions about their home equity.</p>
